java_time_client in Android is made up of the contents of the java-time-client
GitHub repo (https://github.com/google/java-time-client) plus some
Android-specific additions.  Specifically, the following are
Android-only:

Android.bp
OWNERS
README.android
repackaged/...
srcgen/...

Android uses a transformed version of the upstream code. See srcgen/ for the
transformation scripts and repackaged/ for the source.
